---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Ask 4 Trainings"
  description="Terms of Service for Ask 4 Trainings — the conditions governing the use of our training programs and website."
>
  <section class="py-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 xl:px-0">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using Ask 4 Trainings services — including our website, demo sessions, and paid
        training programs — you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do
        not use our services.
      </p>

      <h2>Services</h2>
      <p>
        Ask 4 Trainings provides live online and classroom IT training programs. Course schedules, content,
        and instructors are subject to change. We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any
        course at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Payment & Refund Policy</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fees must be paid before course commencement unless otherwise agreed in writing.</li>
        <li>Refund requests must be submitted within 7 days of the first class.</li>
        <li>No refunds will be issued after 7 days or after course materials have been accessed.</li>
        <li>Transferring enrolment to another batch is subject to availability.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All course materials, recordings, slides, and content provided by Ask 4 Trainings are proprietary and
        protected by copyright. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without prior
        written consent.
      </p>

      <h2>User Conduct</h2>
      <p>
        You agree not to record, redistribute, or share any class recordings or materials without permission.
        Violation may result in immediate termination of access without refund.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        Ask 4 Trainings shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from
        the use of our services. Our liability is limited to the fees paid for the specific course in question.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of Telangana, India. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive
        jurisdiction of courts in Hyderabad.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Ask 4 Trainings, Ameerpet, Hyderabad, Telangana, India.<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:ask4trainings@gmail.com" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">ask4trainings@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
